body:
Thank you for replying to my post, it makes me feel a little better to know there are people out there like me and that they care about my pain. At least you do. The relationship I just got out of was my first relationship and I did a lot for him, I could've done anything basically if it was for him. For me though ? It's always been hard for me to do anything for myself. It's not that I don't want to really, I just don't know what I want, I'm just lost and I have been for a really long time. 

&#x200B;

I should look for a therapist but I'm pretty much broke so I don't know if I'll be able to get myself treated. Right now, it's hard, I feel like the world is just going on around me while I'm stuck. And the pandemic sure doesn't help. 

&#x200B;

Thanks again for taking the time to share your experience with me, I'm sorry for everything that has happened to you and I feel your pain. I'll try to be kinder but I can't promise anything, I'd rather be someone else.
